sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant GUI as Python GUI<br/>gui_c3_state_check_dual.py
    participant Serial as SerialWorker<br/>Sequence tab COM
    participant UNO as UNO Runner<br/>uno_endurance_mcu_auto.ino
    participant PwrA as Stock A Power
    participant PwrB as Stock B Power
    participant Pair as Selected BLE Pair<br/>A/B only
    participant Log as sequence_events / reports

    User->>GUI: Select Runner = MCU Power Runner (UNO)
    User->>GUI: Set pair, cycles, waits, MCU timing
    GUI->>GUI: Validate pair and register baseline
    GUI->>Log: Start new sequence_events CSV
    GUI->>Serial: Open serial monitor
    Serial->>UNO: Attach session
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] MCU_READY

    GUI->>UNO: set off <ms>
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONFIG_UPDATED off
    GUI->>UNO: set ab <ms>
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONFIG_UPDATED ab
    GUI->>UNO: set bs <ms>
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONFIG_UPDATED bs
    GUI->>UNO: set cw <ms>
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONFIG_UPDATED cw
    GUI->>UNO: set dw <ms>
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONFIG_UPDATED dw
    GUI->>UNO: set son <0|1>
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONFIG_UPDATED son
    GUI->>UNO: set sof <0|1>
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONFIG_UPDATED sof
    GUI->>UNO: set stopfail <0|1>
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONFIG_UPDATED stopfail
    GUI->>UNO: run <cycles> <cw_ms> <dw_ms>
    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] ENDURANCE_START cycles=...

    loop cycle 1..N
        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CYCLE_START i/N
        UNO->>PwrA: POWER_A_OFF
        UNO->>PwrB: POWER_B_OFF
        UNO->>PwrA: POWER_A_ON after off_guard
        UNO->>PwrB: POWER_B_ON after A->B delay
        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] SENSOR_ON_OK or SENSOR_ON_NG
        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONNECT_WINDOW_BEGIN ms=...

        GUI->>GUI: Scan selected pair only
        GUI->>Pair: Connect selected A/B pair
        GUI->>Pair: Startup wave
        GUI->>Pair: Battery / GATT check
        GUI->>Pair: Disconnect pair

        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] CONNECT_WINDOW_END
        UNO->>PwrA: POWER_A_OFF
        UNO->>PwrB: POWER_B_OFF
        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] DISCONNECT_WINDOW_BEGIN ms=...
        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] SENSOR_OFF_OK or SENSOR_OFF_NG
        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] DISCONNECT_WINDOW_END

        alt cycle pass
            GUI->>Log: Record PASS
        else cycle fail
            GUI->>Log: Record failure_class
        end
    end

    alt stop button or stop_on_fail
        GUI->>UNO: stop
        UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] ENDURANCE_STOP_REQUEST
    end

    UNO-->>GUI: [STATE] ENDURANCE_DONE pass=... fail=... stopped=...
    GUI->>Log: Export endurance_report_*.csv
    GUI->>Log: Export endurance_report_summary_*.csv
